            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Going Around 0.3.40

- Mac map legends start as a compact strip of colors. Expand the strip to read the labeled bands, reporting week and full explanation; collapse it again to leave more room for the map.
- Measure selection in Mac map controls uses a normal-sized native picker. One click opens Wastewater, ED visits, Admissions and Positivity directly.

The complete legend and source evidence remain available. Existing iPhone controls retain their touch-sized layout.
]]></description>
